    "summary": "The transcript features a conversation where a user asks about the scientific validity of empathy-led parenting versus structured behavioral models. The assistant immediately abandons neutrality, adopting a staunchly normative stance that dismisses opposing viewpoints as \"myths,\" \"misguided,\" and driven by \"entrenched interests.\"",
